Configure Environment variables: 

export TELEGRAM_API_KEY="your_bot_token"
export TELEGRAM_GROUP_ID="-123456789"
export WEB3_PROVIDER_URL="https://mainnet.infura.io/v3/your_key"


Run the system:

python3 alpha_bot.py


Telegram commands:

/start - Initialize bot
/portfolio - View current positions
/analyze 0x... - Check specific contract


Trade Workflow:

sequenceDiagram
    participant Pumpfun
    participant Analyzer
    participant Telegram
    participant Blockchain
    
    Pumpfun->>Analyzer: New listings
    Analyzer->>Rugcheck: Verify contract
    Analyzer->>Twitter: Check social
    Analyzer->>Blockchain: Analyze contract
    Analyzer->>Telegram: Send trade alert
    Telegram->>Blockchain: Execute trade
    Blockchain->>Telegram: Confirm TX
    Telegram->>Database: Log trade
